## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Pelt_Wolf_01
## Category: Professions

# Load order matters: Libs first (LibStub + embedded libraries have no
# dependency on our own namespace and must exist before Core.lua uses
# them), then Core sets up the namespace and saved variables, Constants
# holds pure data, Profession gates every feature module behind having
# learned Skinning, the feature modules depend on all three, and UI
# depends on every feature module existing first. Waypoint.lua and
# LureOverlay.lua are independent of each other - neither calls into
# the other - so their relative order here doesn't matter.
Libs\Libs.xml
Core.lua
Constants.lua
Names.lua
Profession.lua
Quests.lua
Crafting.lua
Waypoint.lua
LureOverlay.lua
AuctionHouse.lua
Options.lua
UI.lua
